v1.1.0 (2026-04-29)
-------------------
- Changed listen port from 8443 to 443 (HTTP, for HAProxy SSL termination upstream)
- Renamed session cookie from "session" to "vpnweb_sid" (avoids HAProxy sticky-session conflict)
- Login endpoint switched to JSONResponse for reliable Set-Cookie delivery
- All fetch() calls now use credentials: 'include'
- Added 30-minute inactivity session timeout (auto-logout)

v1.0.0 (2026-04-28)
-------------------
Initial release.

Features:
- FastAPI + single-page JS frontend for SoftEther VPN management
- Direct JSON-RPC (httpx) and vpncmd subprocess fallback for relay servers
- Bulk endpoints /api/server/all and /api/hubs/{hub}/all (one round-trip load)
- Session management with inactivity timeout (cookie: vpnweb_sid)
- Connection profiles (profiles.json) with per-profile host/port
- VPN Azure toggle and hostname display (vpncmd fallback, JSON-RPC unsupported)
- Dynamic DNS hostname display
- SecureNAT / DHCP config with MAC address display
- User, group, session, MAC/IP table management per hub
- Cascade links, L3 switches, listeners, bridges
- IPSec, OpenVPN, syslog settings
- Hub create/delete, hub online/offline toggle
- SVG logo and favicon (blue gradient circle + padlock)
- vpncmd concurrency semaphore (max 2) for relay server compatibility
- Debug endpoints: /api/debug/ddns, /api/debug/hub/{hub}/users, /api/debug/vcmd
